[["heading","FULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEERING INTERNSHIP • SECTION 16 / 34"],["heading","16. HTTP and REST APIs"],["heading","COMPLETE VISUAL TEACHING EDITION"],["heading","26 individual lessons"],["text","16 original checklist topics · 5 earlier additions · 5 new additions"],["sinhala","","හැම concept එකක්ම English සහ සිංහJලෙන් Jතේරැම් ගන්න. Diagram එක බලෙලො code එක Jහහෝ",464],["sinhala","","example එක trace කරන්න. පසුව interview answer එක Jනාබලො කියන්න.",358],["heading","How to study"],["text","Read the definition, follow the graphical example, reproduce the snippet, explain the result and answer\nthe interview question. Complete the practice task before continuing."],["heading","Scope"],["text","Original topics follow the master checklist; earlier additions follow the previous study guide. New lessons\nare selected for internship interviews. Snippets are educational fragments; imports, setup or surrounding\napp code may be assumed. Expected outputs are reasoned, not a claim that all snippets were executed."]]